## Job Documentation
Read pm/PROJECT_REFERENCE.md for architecture overview.
Read pm/JOB-XX_*.md files for detailed specs of each feature.

## Testing
- Test API routes with curl or Postman
- Default admin: admin@puzzel.com / admin123
- Run `pnpm db:seed` to reset test data

## Git Commits
Use conventional commits:
- feat: new feature
- fix: bug fix
- refactor: code refactoring
- docs: documentation
- chore: maintenance
